"com.parentcontrol.parent_control" content-desc="Location sharing reminder&#10;A local reminder only. It does not grant or revoke location permission on any device." checkable="true" checked="true" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[87,1649][993,1911]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.parentcontrol.parent_control" content-desc="Privacy &amp; data&#10;Export or delete your own account, and see the retention windows the server enforces.&#10;Counts cover the whole family, not just this account.&#10;demo: location retention&#10;30 days&#10;demo: usage retention&#10;90 days&#10;demo: older than the window (all members)&#10;0 location events · 0 usage days&#10;Last retention sweep&#10;Not recorded yet&#10;The sweep timestamp is when the server-wide retention sweep last ran — one global marker row, not this family’s own run time. The sweep deletes signaling rows after 7 days and audit rows after 365 days; location and usage follow each family’s windows above. It runs from the scheduled cron function, not on this phone.&#10;The server decides the scope. A parent export contains the location, usage, alert and audit rows of every family they belong to — including rows recorded about other members — while a child export is limited to their own devices. A copy is saved in this device's app storage and the JSON can be copied to the clipboard.&#10;Deleting requires two confirmations: a warning, then typing DELETE and your account email. Other members’ data is never deleted; an owner with remaining members or active devices is refused." checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,1998][1080,2151]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node></node><node inde